is written to the right of the 'C' symbol. Inside the rectangle, four attri=
butes are listed, each prefixed with a square checkbox: 'String name', 'Str=
ing barcode', 'String category', and 'BigDecimal price'.  These attributes =
define the data members of the 'Item' class, specifying their data types (S=
tring for name, barcode, and category; and BigDecimal for price).  There ar=
