ge-9-3-HNYW6M54.svg" style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<h4 id=3D"inventory">Inventory</h4>
<p>Building on the Catalog class, the Inventory class is a critical compone=
nt of the grocery store system, responsible for managing stock levels of it=
ems. It maintains a mapping between each item's barcode and its correspondi=
ng stock quantity.</p>
<p>Here is the representation of this class.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a class diagram depicting a class named 'In=
ventory'.  The class contains a private member variable `stock` which is a =
map with String keys (representing barcodes) and Integer values (representi=
