rice.  Below the interface, two classes, `AmountBasedStrategy` and `Percent=
ageBasedStrategy`, implement this interface.  Dashed lines with open arrowh=
eads indicate that these classes implement the interface. `AmountBasedStrat=
egy` contains a private member variable `BigDecimal discountAmount`, while =
`PercentageBasedStrategy` contains a private member variable `BigDecimal di=
